# Scoop & Swirl - Product Requirements Document (PRD)
**Frontend Web Application + Responsive Chatbot**

- **Project Type**: Frontend-only responsive web application
- **Brand**: Scoop & Swirl
- **Currency**: PKR (Rs.)

---

## 1. Project Overview
- **Scoop & Swirl** is a modern, attractive and fully responsive ice cream shop website. Customers can browse products, view flavors and prices, search and filter products, add items to a shopping cart, manage quantities, and complete a frontend checkout flow.
- The website includes a responsive AI-style customer chatbot called **ScoopBot** that helps customers discover flavors, prices, offers and product recommendations.
- The project is frontend-only and uses mock/local data. No real payment gateway, backend, database, authentication, or external AI API is required for the first version.

---

## 2. Goals
- Create a beautiful professional ice cream shop frontend.
- Make the website fully responsive on desktop, tablet and mobile.
- Provide interactive product browsing and a functional frontend shopping cart.
- Add a responsive customer-support chatbot.
- Use reusable React components and realistic Pakistani prices in PKR.
- Use mock data for products, customers, orders and chatbot responses.

---

## 3. Technology & Architecture
- **Frontend**: React, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, responsive design and component-based UI.
- **Development AI**: Antigravity AI will generate, modify and improve the frontend implementation.
- **Chatbot**: Rule-based/mock AI chatbot using predefined shop and product data rather than a real AI API.
- **Architecture**: Component-based frontend architecture with Pages, reusable Components, local Data and frontend State.
  - **Pages**: Home, Menu, Product Details, Cart, Checkout, About and Contact.
  - **Components**: Navbar, ProductCard, CategoryFilter, Cart, Chatbot, ChatMessage, Footer and reusable buttons.
  - **State**: Cart, Favorites and Chatbot Conversation. No backend or database is required.

---

## 4. Brand & Visual Design
- **Theme**: Cute, premium, colorful and modern ice cream shop.
- **Suggested palette**: cream/vanilla, soft pink, strawberry pink, chocolate brown, soft purple and white.
- **UI**: rounded cards, soft shadows, large product images, smooth hover effects, attractive buttons, subtle animations and clean spacing.
- **Typography**: clean, friendly and readable.

